<view class="page"><view class="title">入梦 · {{companion.name}}</view><view class="note">练习不会进入正式聊天与长期记忆，确认应用后才更新人物。</view><button bindtap="start" disabled="{{busy}}">{{state.status === 'draft' ? '继续梦境' : '开启新梦境'}}</button><button bindtap="reload" disabled="{{busy}}">重新读取</button>
<view wx:if="{{state.status === 'draft'}}"><fields schema="{{schema}}" values="{{form}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bind:edit="edit" /><button bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy}}">暂存编辑</button>
<view wx:for="{{state.rounds}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-item="round" class="card"><view class="plain">我：{{round.message}}</view><view wx:for="{{round.choices}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-item="choice" class="message"><text>{{choice.content}}</text><button wx:if="{{!round.feedback}}" bindtap="choose" data-round="{{round.id}}" data-choice="{{choice.id}}">选这段回应</button></view><button wx:if="{{!round.feedback}}" bindtap="choose" data-round="{{round.id}}">直接纠正这一轮</button><view wx:if="{{round.feedback}}" class="note">这一轮已反馈</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{roundId}}" class="card"><view>已选练习轮次 {{choiceId ? '及回应' : ''}}</view><textarea value="{{correction}}" data-field="correction" bindinput="input" maxlength="500" auto-height placeholder="希望怎样调整" /><radio-group bindchange="scope"><label><radio value="always" checked />始终</label><label><radio value="context" />类似情境</label><label><radio value="occasional" />偶尔</label></radio-group><button bindtap="feedback" disabled="{{busy}}">提交反馈</button></view>
<textarea value="{{message}}" data-field="message" bindinput="input" maxlength="2000" auto-height placeholder="假设一个聊天情境……" /><radio-group bindchange="mode"><label><radio value="compare" checked />三个候选</label><label><radio value="free" />自由试聊</label></radio-group><button bindtap="generate" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">继续练习</button>
<view class="section">校准片段</view><view wx:for="{{fragments}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><textarea value="{{item.text}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-key="text" bindinput="fragment" maxlength="500" auto-height /><view>确认纳入 <switch checked="{{item.confirmed}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-key="confirmed" bindchange="fragment" /></view><picker range="{{['始终','类似情境','偶尔']}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="fragmentScope"><view>范围：{{item.scope}}（点击修改）</view></picker><button bindtap="removeFragment" data-id="{{item.id}}">移除片段</button></view>
<button bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy}}">保存并更新应用预览</button><view class="card"><view>应用预览</view><view class="plain">{{state.previewProfile.speakingStyle}}</view></view><button bindtap="apply" disabled="{{busy}}">结束入梦并确认应用</button><button bindtap="discard" disabled="{{busy}}">丢弃梦境</button></view>
<button bindtap="rebase" disabled="{{busy}}" wx:if="{{state}}">核对并更新人物版本基准</button><view class="section">版本恢复</view><view wx:for="{{state.versions}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view>{{item.createdAt}} · {{item.kind}}</view><view>{{item.profile.speakingStyle}}</view><button bindtap="restore" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">恢复此版本</button></view><view class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="note">{{notice}}</view></view>
